"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_size\":\"cover\"},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"793f4c8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_wrap\":\"wrap\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=88bc9b2\"},\"z_index\":10},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1424faa\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f9a8dd5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Primer piso<\\/p>\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\"},\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Quattrocento\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#8F7548\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"bfb7407\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"INTIMIDAD Y HORIZONTE\",\"header_size\":\"h1\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\",\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Marcellus\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":25,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_text_transform\":\"uppercase\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"title_color\":\"#8F7548\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"31d51cf\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2e730c8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"_flex_order\":\"end\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f9e0092\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>La primera planta se desarrolla sobre el volumen central y alberga cuatro dormitorios cuidadosamente distribuidos.<\\/p><p>El dormitorio principal cuenta con ba\\u00f1o privado con ba\\u00f1era y ducha, vestidor con luz natural y acceso directo a una terraza privada desde donde se pueden contemplar las puestas de sol<br \\/>sobre el paisaje rural. Dos dormitorios dobles adicionales disponen de ba\\u00f1o privado, mientras que un cuarto dormitorio comparte un ba\\u00f1o.<\\/p><p>Los balcones franceses y los armarios empotrados garantizan luminosidad, funcionalidad y una conexi\\u00f3n constante con el exterior.<\\/p>\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\"},\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Quattrocento\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#8F7548\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"d024808\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"flex_justify_content\":\"space-evenly\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"76f0e90\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image_size\":\"thumbnail\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/Logos_RGBSello_2_B.jpg\",\"id\":276,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"200\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_flex_align_self\":\"flex-start\"},\"element