,\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":33}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"cad21ae\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2bb72af\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":33}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0adc482\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"793f4c8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_wrap\":\"wrap\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1424faa\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f9a8dd5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Primer piso<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"bfb7407\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"INTIMIDAD Y HORIZONTE\",\"header_size\":\"h1\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"d024808\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"76f0e90\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image_size\":\"thumbnail\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2e730c8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f9e0092\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>La primera planta se desarrolla sobre el volumen central y alberga<br \\/>cuatro dormitorios cuidadosamente distribuidos.<br \\/>El dormitorio principal cuenta con ba\\u00f1o privado con ba\\u00f1era y<br \\/>ducha, vestidor con luz natural y acceso directo a una terraza<br \\/>privada desde donde se pueden contemplar las puestas de sol<br \\/>sobre el paisaje rural. Dos dormitorios dobles adicionales<br \\/>disponen de ba\\u00f1o privado, mientras que un cuarto dormitorio<br \\/>comparte un ba\\u00f1o.<br \\/>Los balcones franceses y los armarios empotrados garantizan<br \\/>luminosidad, funcionalidad y una conexi\\u00f3n constante con el<br \\/>exterior<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"03230bf\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row-reverse\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7801fc0\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e1cfad1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"c3e6dfa\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":0,\"right\":0,\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":true},\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7c80f09\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e5cc806\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image_size\":\"thumbnail\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"c6a9bbe\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"86876cf\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"c8de155\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"150\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"150\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"863a9fb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>M\\u00c1S ALL\\u00c1 DE SU EST\\u00c9TICA, SA CALMA INTEGRA SOLUCIONES SOSTENIBLES<br \\/>QUE OPTIMIZAN RECURSOS Y REDUCEN EL IMPACTO AMBIENTAL, COMO LA<br \\/>GESTI\\u00d3N EFICIENTE DEL AGUA, EL USO DE MATERIALES LOCALES Y LA<br \\/>PRESERVACI\\u00d3N DE LA VEGETACI\\u00d3N AUT\\u00d3CTONA, HACIENDO DE LA<br \\/>SOSTENIBILIDAD UNA PARTE ESENCIAL DEL PROYECTO.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"122546d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_wrap\":\"wrap\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"150\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"150\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4211149\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4f47ae8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>S\\u00f3tano<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"2f16008\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"BIENESTAR EN\\nCUALQUIER ESTACI\\u00d3N\",\"header_size\":\"h1\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"45fb5b7\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f38d88a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>El nivel inferior est\\u00e1 dedicado al bienestar y el disfrute,<br \\/>con un gimnasio, una sauna, una zona de spa, una<br \\/>bodega y una segunda sala de m\\u00e1quinas. Estos espacios<br \\/>complementarios permiten una experiencia de confort<br \\/>completa en cualquier \\u00e9poca del a\\u00f1o.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"