ENIBILIDAD UNA PARTE ESENCIAL DEL PROYECTO.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"122546d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_wrap\":\"wrap\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"150\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"150\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4211149\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4f47ae8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>S\\u00f3tano<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"2f16008\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"BIENESTAR EN\\nCUALQUIER ESTACI\\u00d3N\",\"header_size\":\"h1\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"45fb5b7\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f38d88a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>El nivel inferior est\\u00e1 dedicado al bienestar y el disfrute,<br \\/>con un gimnasio, una sauna, una zona de spa, una<br \\/>bodega y una segunda sala de m\\u00e1quinas. Estos espacios<br \\/>complementarios permiten una experiencia de confort<br \\/>completa en cualquier \\u00e9poca del a\\u00f1o.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"f3966a8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"background_background\":\"classic\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"41e9156\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image_size\":\"thumbnail\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
