\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Desde el patio ajardinado se accede a un vest\\u00edbulo<br \\/>articulado por una escultural escalera de caracol<br \\/>que conecta los tres niveles. La zona de d\\u00eda se organiza<br \\/>en torno a un amplio sal\\u00f3n-comedor con chimenea<br \\/>central y grandes ventanales que integran el paisaje y la<br \\/>luz natural. La cocina, con isla central, despensa y b\\u00f3veda<br \\/>cer\\u00e1mica artesanal, se abre a una terraza con vistas a<br \\/>los algarrobos. En el ala opuesta, un dormitorio en suite<br \\/>con vestidor, terraza privada y ducha exterior ofrece<br \\/>una experiencia \\u00edntima en contacto con el entorno.<\\/p>\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=2831239\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"19cd972\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"content_width\":\"full\",\"min_height\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":80,\"sizes\":[]},\"min_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"min_height_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"66de000\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/Detalle-Salon-2.png\",\"id\":266,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_position\":\"center left\",\"background_size\":\"cover\"},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"01e6cd1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/7.png\",\"id\":267,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_position\":\"center center\",\"background_size\":\"cover\"},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"b59758b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/10.jpg\",\"id\":268,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_size\":\"cover\"},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"793f4c8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_wrap\":\"wrap\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=88bc9b2\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1424faa\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f9a8dd5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Primer piso<\\/p>\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=2831239\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"bfb7407\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"INTIMIDAD Y HORIZONTE\",\"header_size\":\"h1\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\",\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=95aec11\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"31d51cf\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2