ts\":[{\"id\":\"f897f18\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>SA CALMA ES UN PROYECTO<br \\/>QUE CONCIBE LA TIERRA<br \\/>COMO SU PUNTO DE PARTIDA<br \\/>Y LA SERENIDAD COMO<br \\/>SU VALOR ESENCIAL.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Marcellus\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":22,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":25,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2608edb\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"79464bb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>En el coraz\\u00f3n de la campi\\u00f1a mallorquina, entre<br \\/>algarrobos centenarios y campos ondulantes, Sa Calma se<br \\/>integra con naturalidad en su entorno, reinterpretando la<br \\/>tradici\\u00f3n desde una mirada contempor\\u00e1nea. La parcela<br \\/>respeta la vegetaci\\u00f3n existente y preserva los \\u00e1rboles que<br \\/>estructuran el paisaje, mientras que cada apertura,<br \\/>terraza y recorrido se orienta a conectar la vivienda con<br \\/>el horizonte rural y sus cambios a lo largo del a\\u00f1o.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Quattrocento\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":17,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#8F7548\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"0431dc9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"VER PROYECTO\",\"align\":\"center\",\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"1\",\"right\":\"1\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"1\",\"isLinked\":true},\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=88bc9b2\",\"button_text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\"},\"link\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/Planos_SA-CALMA.pdf\",\"is_external\":\"on\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"98cdeb3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"min_height\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"min_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"min_height_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"background_background\":\"video\",\"background_video_fallback\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/fondo2.png\",\"id\":201,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"1255aab\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"150\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"150\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/Fondos_TEXTURAS_WEB_1.png\",\"id\":206,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_size\":\"cover\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5926657\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>LAS FACHADAS COMBINAN MAMPOSTER\\u00cdA DE PIEDRA NATURAL EN EL<br \\/>VOLUMEN CENTRAL CON REVESTIMIENTOS DE CAL EN TONOS OCRE Y<br \\/>ARENA EN EL RESTO, GENERANDO UNA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N ARM\\u00d3NICA CON EL<br \\/>PAISAJE. EN EL INTERIOR, LA PIEDRA Y LA MADERA RECUPERADA APORTAN<br \\/>CALIDEZ Y AUTENTICIDAD, MIENTRAS QUE LAS TEJAS \\u00c1RABES REFUERZAN<br \\/>EL V\\u00cdNCULO CON LA ARQUITECTURA MALLORQUINA.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Marcellus\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":22,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":25,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"def9647\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_wrap\":\"wrap\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"150\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"150\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=94010a7\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f9a09f9\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1c5b9ba\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"DISE\\u00d1ADO <br>\\nPARA DISFRUTAR <br>\\nTODO EL A\\u00d1O\",\"header_size\":\"h1\",\"align\":\"start\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Marcellus\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_text_transform\":\"uppercase\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\",\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=957a43d\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"c47610c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3fe820d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image_size\":\"thumbnail\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/Sello_2_Blanco.png\",\"id\":183,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"align\":\"center\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"150\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"47d408f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c0fdd8e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Las \\u00e1reas exteriores se organizan a<br \\/>trav\\u00e9s de terrazas, p\\u00e9rgolas y una<br \\/>chimenea al aire libre que generan<br \\/>espacios tanto sociales como \\u00edntimos.<br \\/>La piscina, orientada al paisaje,<br \\/>incorpora soluciones sostenibles<br \\/>con sistemas de almacenamiento y<br \\/>reutilizaci\\u00f3n de agua. Un volumen<br \\/>anexo con porche, barbacoa y servicios<br \\/>completa el conjunto, mientras que la<br \\/>vivienda se expande hacia el exterior de<br \\/>forma natural, integrando<br \\/>la vida cotidiana con el entorno.<\\/p>\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=2831239\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=957a43d\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"9d632ea\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"cd94648\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/4.png\",\"id\":222,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"medium_large\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"d8b600f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"150\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":