\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"EL CORAZ\\u00d3N DEL HOGAR\",\"header_size\":\"h1\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\",\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\"},\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Marcellus\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":25,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_text_transform\":\"uppercase\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"title_color\":\"#8F7548\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"bc3fba6\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"20bef4a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Desde el patio ajardinado se accede a un vest\\u00edbulo articulado por una escultural escalera de caracol que conecta los tres niveles. La zona de d\\u00eda se organiza en torno a un amplio sal\\u00f3n-comedor con chimenea<br \\/>central y grandes ventanales que integran el paisaje y la luz natural. La cocina, con isla central, despensa y b\\u00f3veda<br \\/>cer\\u00e1mica artesanal, se abre a una terraza con vistas a los algarrobos. En el ala opuesta, un dormitorio en suite<br \\/>con vestidor, terraza privada y ducha exterior ofrece una experiencia \\u00edntima en contacto con el entorno.<\\/p>\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\"},\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Quattrocento\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#8F7548\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"19cd972\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"content_width\":\"full\",\"min_height\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":80,\"sizes\":[]},\"min_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":50,\"sizes\":[]},\"min_height_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"66de000\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/Detalle-Salon-2.png\",\"id\":266,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_position\":\"center left\",\"background_size\":\"cover\"},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"01e6cd1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/7.png\",\"id\":267,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_position\":\"center center\",\"background_size\":\"cover\"},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"b59758b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/10.jpg\",\"id\":268,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_size\":\"cover\"},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"793f4c8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_wrap\":\"wrap\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px