ntempor\\u00e1nea. La parcela respeta la vegetaci\\u00f3n existente y preserva los \\u00e1rboles que estructuran el paisaje, mientras que cada apertura, terraza y recorrido se orienta a conectar la vivienda con el horizonte rural y sus cambios a lo largo del a\\u00f1o.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Quattrocento\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":17,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#8F7548\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\"},\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"0431dc9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"VER PROYECTO\",\"align\":\"center\",\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"1\",\"right\":\"1\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"1\",\"isLinked\":true},\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=88bc9b2\",\"button_text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\"},\"link\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/Planos_SA-CALMA.pdf\",\"is_external\":\"on\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"98cdeb3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"min_height\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"min_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":50,\"sizes\":[]},\"min_height_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"background_background\":\"video\",\"background_video_fallback\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/fondo2.png\",\"id\":201,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"1255aab\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"150\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"150\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/S_A_calma\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/Fondos_TEXTURAS_WEB_1.png\",\"id\":206,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_size\":\"cover\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5926657\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>LAS FACHADAS COMBINAN MAMPOSTER\\u00cdA DE PIEDRA NATURAL EN EL<br \\/>VOLUMEN CENTRAL CON REVESTIMIENTOS DE CAL EN TONOS OCRE Y<br \\/>ARENA EN EL RESTO, GENERANDO UNA INTEGRACI\\u00d3N ARM\\u00d3NICA CON EL<br \\/>PAISAJE. EN EL INTERIOR, LA PIEDRA Y LA MADERA RECUPERADA APORTAN<br \\/>CALIDEZ Y AUTENTICIDAD, MIENTRAS QUE LAS TEJAS \\u00c1RABES REFUERZAN<br \\/>EL V\\u00cdNCULO CON LA ARQUITECTURA MALLORQUINA.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Marcellus\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":22,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":25,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=a23def7\"},\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"def9647\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_wrap\":\"wrap\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"150\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"150\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=94010a7\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f9a09f9\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elemen